example:
提供方用 MyBatis 做条件更新，并在自己的事务里提交。影响行数为 0 就抛出运行时异常：

```java
@Mapper
public interface StockMapper {
    @Update("UPDATE stock SET qty = qty - #{qty} WHERE sku = #{sku} AND qty >= #{qty}")
    int deductIfEnough(@Param("sku") String sku, @Param("qty") int qty);
}

@DubboService(version = "1.0.0", group = "order")
public class InventoryServiceImpl implements InventoryService {
    private final StockMapper stockMapper;

    public InventoryServiceImpl(StockMapper stockMapper) {
        this.stockMapper = stockMapper;
    }

    @Override
    @Transactional
    public void deduct(String sku, int qty) {
        if (stockMapper.deductIfEnough(sku, qty) == 0) {
            throw new InventoryExhausted(sku);
        }
    }
}
```

消费方在本地事务之外调用。retries 为 0，避免同一次请求打两次：

```java
@DubboReference(version = "1.0.0", group = "order", cluster = "failfast", retries = 0)
private InventoryService inventory;

public void place(String sku) {
    inventory.deduct(sku, 1);
}
```
